\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O PERFFECT Love, all human thought transcending
\par Lowly we kneel in prayer before Thy throne,
\par That theirs may be the love which knows no ending
\par Whom Thou for evermore dost join in one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O perfect Life, be Thou their full assurance
\par Of tender charity and steadfast faith,
\par Of patient hope, and quiet brave endurance,
\par With childlike trust that fears nor pain nor death.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Grant them the joy which brightens earthly sorrow,
\par Grant them the peace which calms all earthly strife;
\par And to life's day the glorious unknown morrow
\par That dawns upon eternal love and life.
\par                                     Amen.
\par \cf1\ul\b  \f1\fs16 
\par 
\par }

